{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Engage in card-based combat set in a fantasy world!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Centuries ago, mythical creatures from the forest of eternal night were exiled by the ancient king and imprisoned by powerful magic. Over time, the spell weakened, and now they free to roam the land once again, seeking vengeance against the kingdom of Lorianth. The current king summons the three heroes Aldred, Veyndara and Gorak to face this threat and protect the realm from destruction!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764270/extras/9def8e61110ee49b811e5d4478c18ddd.poster.avif?t=1754701667\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764270/extras/9def8e61110ee49b811e5d4478c18ddd.webm?t=1754701667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764270/extras/9def8e61110ee49b811e5d4478c18ddd.mp4?t=1754701667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle Mythic Maidens Arena is a card-based combat game suitable for all skill levels. Face beautiful but dangerous combatants, all with unique stats, strengths and weaknesses. In each turn, you are randomly dealt cards of four action types including Shield, Attack, Fury and Disarm. Several cards can be played in the same turn to shorten an opponent\u2019s turn, inflict damage, double your own strength or block incoming attacks. Use quick-thinking strategy to turn the tide and dominate your buxom opponents!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764270/extras/89763c91052767f45c2d0269e6b38a20.poster.avif?t=1754701667\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764270/extras/89763c91052767f45c2d0269e6b38a20.webm?t=1754701667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764270/extras/89763c91052767f45c2d0269e6b38a20.mp4?t=1754701667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 3 heroes and face off against 15 female Chaos Invaders!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically play cards of 4 action types including Shield, Attack, Fury and Disarm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guard against incoming attacks, double your own attack power and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casually replay battles at any time to further hone your skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy alluring character designs and a lush fantasy world setting!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764270/extras/d133a39bd180c0f58122acfdfb28de76.poster.avif?t=1754701667\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764270/extras/d133a39bd180c0f58122acfdfb28de76.webm?t=1754701667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764270/extras/d133a39bd180c0f58122acfdfb28de76.mp4?t=1754701667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764270/extras/5f1fa4cff884578972c2db626546d715.poster.avif?t=1754701667\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/st